AI Software Factory Workspace
=============================

This VM contains common compilers, package clients, test tools, and rootless
container tooling. A repository must still pin its exact language and dependency
versions using lockfiles and versioned build containers.

Rules:
- Never store cloud access keys, registry passwords, or production data here.
- Pull dependencies through the approved package repository.
- Run the repository's local test command before pushing.
- Build releases in CI; local images are development evidence only.
- Prefer Podman/Buildah rootless mode and never mount a privileged Docker socket.

